data: {"text":"1. The Lessor hereby grants to the Lessee, and the Lessee hereby accepts from the Lessor, the tenancy of the residential"}

data: {"text":" premises bearing Flat No. 502, 5th Floor, Oraon Heights, Lalpur, Ranchi - 834001, measuring approximately 950 sq. ft., being a semi"}

data: {"text":"-furnished flat comprising two bedrooms, hall, kitchen, and one bathroom with attached balcony (hereinafter referred to as \"the demised premises\") for a"}

data: {"text":" period of 11 (eleven) months commencing from 01.06.2026 to 30.04.2027, both dates inclusive."}

data: {"text":"\n\n2. The monthly rent for the demised premises shall be Rs. 15,000/- (Rupees Fifteen Thousand only) per month, which"}

data: {"text":" shall be payable by the Lessee to the Lessor on or before the 7th day of every English"}

data: {"text":" calendar month without any demand or notice via UPI transfer to the Lessor's SBI bank account details as"}

data: {"text":" provided separately.\n\n3. The Lessee has paid to the Lessor a sum of Rs. 45,000/- (Rup"}

data: {"text":"ees Forty Five Thousand only) as security deposit, the receipt whereof is hereby acknowledged by the Lessor. The"}

data: {"text":" said security deposit shall remain with the Lessor during the entire period of tenancy and shall be refunded to"}

data: {"text":" the Lessee upon vacation of the demised premises after adjusting any dues,"}

data: {"text":" damages, or liabilities, if any.\n\n4. The monthly rent shall be subject to an annual"}

data: {"text":" escalation of 10% (ten percent) with effect from the commencement of each subsequent year of tenancy,"}

data: {"text":" if this agreement is renewed or extended by mutual consent of both parties.\n\n5. The"}

data: {"text":" Lessee shall be responsible for payment of electricity charges, water charges, and society maintenance charges pertaining to the demised premises during"}

data: {"text":" the period of tenancy. The Lessor shall bear the cost of major structural repairs to the building and the"}

data: {"text":" demised premises.\n\n6. The demised premises shall be used exclusively for residential purposes by the Lessee and his immediate family members only. The Lessee shall not use"}

data: {"text":" the premises for any commercial, business, or other non-residential purposes whatsoever.\n\n7. The Lessee shall not sub-let, assign"}

data: {"text":", transfer, or part with possession of the demised premises or any part thereof to any third party without the prior written consent of the Lessor, which consent may"}

data: {"text":" be withheld at the sole discretion of the Lessor.\n\n8. The Lessee shall not make any structural alterations, additions, or modifications to the demised premises"}

data: {"text":" without the prior written consent of the Lessor. Any alterations made with such consent shall become the property of the Lessor without"}

data: {"text":" any compensation to the Lessee.\n\n9. Either party may terminate this tenancy agreement by giving 2 (two) months' prior written notice to the other party. Upon"}

data: {"text":" expiry of the notice period, the Lessee shall peacefully hand over vacant possession of the demised premises to the Lessor.\n\n10. In"}

data: {"text":" the event of default in payment of rent for a period exceeding 15 (fifteen) days from the due date, the Lessor shall"}

data: {"text":" be entitled to terminate this agreement and recover possession of the demised premises, in addition to claiming"}

data: {"text":" all outstanding dues and damages.\n\n11. If either party is prevented"}

data: {"text":" from performing their obligations under this agreement due to circumstances beyond their reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, natural disasters, governmental actions, or pandemic restrictions"}

data: {"text":", such non-performance shall be excused during the continuance of such circumstances.\n\n12. Any"}

data: {"text":" dispute arising out of or in connection with this agreement shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts at Ranchi, Jharkhand, and"}

data: {"text":" shall be governed by the laws of India.\n\n13. The Lessee acknowledges that he is a salaried IT professional employed with"}

data: {"text":" Tata Consultancy Services (TCS) and has the financial capacity to pay the rent and comply with the"}

data: {"text":" terms of this agreement.\n\n14. The Lessee shall maintain the demised premises in good and tenantable condition and shall be liable for any"}

data: {"text":" damage caused due to negligence or misuse, the cost of rectification wher"}

data: {"text":"eof may be adjusted from the security deposit.\n\n15. The Lessee shall allow the Lessor or his authorized representative to"}

data: {"text":" inspect the demised premises at reasonable times after giving reasonable notice, provided such inspection does"}

data: {"text":" not unreasonably interfere with the Lessee's peaceful enjoyment of the premises.\n\n16. Upon termination of this ten"}

data: {"text":"ancy, the Lessee shall hand over the demised premises to the Lessor in the same condition as received, subject to normal wear and tear, failing"}

data: {"text":" which the cost of restoration may be recovered from the security deposit.\n\n17. This agreement shall be executed in the presence of two witnesses who"}

data: {"text":" shall sign as attesters to the execution hereof, and the same"}

data: {"text":" shall be duly stamped and registered as per the provisions of the Indian Stamp Act, 1899 and"}

data: {"text":" the Registration Act, 1908.\n\n18. This agreement contains the entire understanding between the parties and supersedes all prior negotiations, representations, or agreements relating"}

data: {"text":" to the subject matter hereof, and may only be modified by a written instrument executed by both parties."}

